; The waiting shed: Sophia's investigation on the bench (see WaitingShedSequence). Positions are in the space of this scene's root;
; in the dream the root is at world (65, -12.452, -16). The bench holds, seen from its open front (+Z): at its left (west) end the notebook, in the middle the main clipping lying OVER the
; videotape, at its right end the supposed sister's note; Sophia's backpack stands on the ground beside the bench. The hinged box is gone: the token is no longer in it (it comes with the final letter).
