; The end of the investigation: the leaf cover over the final letter, at the foot of the cracked front-west pillar (Pillar1, the one with the crack and the mend; its +Z face is toward the open front), the letter itself, and the token
; (the one collectible, hidden and not takable until the letter has been read). Not under PersonalEffects: it is in every look of the shelter, so the camcorder's viewfinder shows the leaves.
; (The first candidate, the back-left nook behind the bench's west end, was measured and rejected: from the fixed lens the whole trail to it spans 6 % of the 4:3 frame and its end is hidden by the bench's west leg.)
