; The ground of the clearing and the thicket round the camcorder, made in code (ShedGroundDressing): patches of moss, humus and pine needles, leaf drifts, rocks, low plants; a dense ring of plants round
; the camcorder with a narrow trodden path from the slab's corner to the cameraman's place behind the eyepiece. The thicket goes under CamcorderCover.
[node name="GroundDressing" type="Node3D" parent="." node_paths=PackedStringArray("cover")]
script = ExtResource("19_dressing")
cover = NodePath("../CamcorderCover")
